      "worked_solution": "We count the number of rhombuses. We see that there are $3$ rhombuses.\n\n We count the total number of shapes. We see that there are $7$ shapes.\n\nHence, the ratio of circles to triangles is$\\frac{3}{7}$\n\nSo the missing number is $7.$",
